# A plain tile click hits pixels, like the client and BYOND: MetaStation's supply console
# (67,152) shares its tile with a west wall light (layer 4.25) and two door buttons drawn on the
# wall; the click on the tile's center opens the console, not the light above it.
map click_pixels.dmm
bot alice 3,3

test console_under_a_wall_light
  alice click 2,3
  until alice.windows.Cargo exists
